# Agent-written campaign reports: real concentrations + rewards, same category as
# bo_trajectory/. The Analyzer's write_report names these itself, so match the family
# rather than one filename (observed: final_campaign_results.md,
# final_campaign_results_analysis.md, final_campaign_results_analysis_run<jobid>.md).
final_campaign_results*.md
analysis/

# write_report resolves a RELATIVE out_path against the repo root, and the agent has
# passed "scratch/dsegura/..." (no leading slash) intending the real /scratch. That
# creates a scratch/ tree inside the working copy full of campaign reports.
scratch/

